          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuba Omukama nagamba ati, “Mukagurwa obuzira mpiha, na mbwenu nimwija kuchungurwa obuzira mpiha.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 52:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama Ruhanga wenene nashuba nagamba ati, “Orwo obubere mwabaire mufurukiire Misiri, mukaba mufurukiireyo buli bweyendezi bwanyu. Kyonkai Abaasiria bakabatwara rwamani, buzima kutali kugir'oti n'okubagura bakabagura. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 52:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbwenu ekintekire aha kiki, kubona eihanga lyange nitulitwara bati kushai kushai? Abatwazi banyu nibeshalingya; omushana gwona nibasiba nibangaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 52:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikyo eihanga lyange lilimanyira; kuba kir'ekyo tulimanya okwo ebi n'inye nabigamba; leba, n'inye nyenene.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
